=== subscribes a client to receive out-of-band data.yml
info:
  name: subscribes a client to receive out-of-band data
  type: http
  seq: 1

http:
  method: POST
  url: "{{baseUrl}}/streams?callbackUrl=https://tonys-server.com"
  params:
    - name: callbackUrl
      value: https://tonys-server.com
      type: query
      description: |
        the location where data will be sent.  Must be network accessible
        by the source server
  auth: inherit

settings:
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: inherit
  followRedirects: true
  maxRedirects: 5
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false

docs: subscribes a client to receive out-of-band data

note NeedsInput opencollection.yml | servers | no server gives an absolute URL; set `baseUrl` in an environment before sending
note Dropped subscribes a client to receive out-of-band data.yml | paths./streams.post.callbacks | callbacks are not imported
